# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# Rationale: 0.4.0 was packaged from a Windows working tree that had 16 CRLF
# files, so the published zip did not match the tag byte for byte
# (docs/plans/v0.4.1.md D2). Never let the checkout decide the published bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binary assets untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
